{"cats":["Momentum","Breakouts","Volume","Trend & pullbacks","Oscillators","Relative strength","Weakness"],"meta":[{"id":"up4","name":"4% breakout day","cat":"Momentum","desc":"Up 4% or more today on volume above yesterday's \u2014 Pradeep Bonde's momentum-burst trigger.","metric":"Day %","fmt":"pct","sort":"metric"},{"id":"burst20","name":"Momentum burst: +20% in 5 days","cat":"Momentum","desc":"Gained 20% or more over the last 5 sessions. Fast movers; check for news before chasing.","metric":"5-day %","fmt":"pct","sort":"metric"},{"id":"gap_up","name":"Gap up held","cat":"Momentum","desc":"Opened 2%+ above yesterday's close, never filled yesterday's high, and closed above the open.","metric":"Gap %","fmt":"pct","sort":"metric"},{"id":"rs_jump","name":"RS rating jump","cat":"Momentum","desc":"RS rating up 15+ points in a week to 70 or higher \u2014 fresh relative-strength surge.","metric":"RS \u03941W","fmt":"num","sort":"metric"},{"id":"leaders","name":"Leaders near highs","cat":"Momentum","desc":"RS 90+ and within 5% of the 52-week high.","metric":null,"fmt":"num","sort":"rs"},{"id":"high52","name":"New 52-week closing high","cat":"Breakouts","desc":"Closed above the highest close of the previous 252 sessions.","metric":"Vol \u00d7","fmt":"x","sort":"rs"},{"id":"high2y","name":"Highest close in 2 years","cat":"Breakouts","desc":"Today's close is the highest of the full ~2-year history held for the site.","metric":"Vol \u00d7","fmt":"x","sort":"rs"},{"id":"darvas","name":"Darvas box breakout","cat":"Breakouts","desc":"Prior 20-day range no wider than 15%, closed above the box top on 1.5\u00d7 average volume.","metric":"Box %","fmt":"pct","sort":"rs"},{"id":"bb_break","name":"Bollinger band breakout","cat":"Breakouts","desc":"Closed above the upper Bollinger band (20, 2) on 1.5\u00d7 average volume.","metric":"Vol \u00d7","fmt":"x","sort":"rs"},{"id":"stage2_bo","name":"Stage 2 breakout (Weinstein)","cat":"Breakouts","desc":"Crossed above the 30-week (150-day) average in the last 5 sessions, average flat or rising, close above 50 DMA.","metric":"Vol \u00d7","fmt":"x","sort":"rs"},{"id":"vcp","name":"Volatility contraction (VCP)","cat":"Breakouts","desc":"Stage-2 trend within 15% of the 52-week high, with three successively tighter ranges (sessions 40\u201320, 20\u201310, last 10), the last one 10% or less, and volume drying up. Minervini's VCP \u2014 watch for the breakout above the tight range.","metric":"Last 10d range %","fmt":"pct","sort":"rs"},{"id":"vol_spike","name":"Volume spike up","cat":"Volume","desc":"Volume at least 3\u00d7 the 50-day average and price up 2% or more today.","metric":"Vol \u00d7","fmt":"x","sort":"metric"},{"id":"pocket_pivot","name":"Pocket pivot","cat":"Volume","desc":"Up day whose volume beats the largest down-day volume of the prior 10 sessions, closing above the 10 and 50 DMA within 15% of the 52-week high (Morales & Kacher).","metric":"Vol \u00d7","fmt":"x","sort":"rs"},{"id":"vol_high","name":"Highest volume in a year (up day)","cat":"Volume","desc":"Today's volume is the largest of the past 252 sessions and the stock closed up.","metric":"Vol \u00d7","fmt":"x","sort":"metric"},{"id":"dryup","name":"Volume dry-up near highs","cat":"Volume","desc":"5-day average volume \u2264 50% of the 50-day average while the stock holds within 10% of its high above the 50 DMA \u2014 supply exhausted.","metric":"5d vol \u00d7","fmt":"x","sort":"rs"},{"id":"trend_template","name":"Trend template (Minervini)","cat":"Trend & pullbacks","desc":"Passes all 8 Minervini trend conditions with RS \u2265 70.","metric":null,"fmt":"num","sort":"rs"},{"id":"golden","name":"Golden cross","cat":"Trend & pullbacks","desc":"50 DMA crossed above the 200 DMA in the last 5 sessions.","metric":null,"fmt":"num","sort":"rs"},{"id":"ema_up","name":"20 EMA crossed above 50 EMA","cat":"Trend & pullbacks","desc":"Bullish crossover in the last 3 sessions, price above the 20 EMA.","metric":null,"fmt":"num","sort":"rs"},{"id":"pb20","name":"Pullback to 20 EMA in uptrend","cat":"Trend & pullbacks","desc":"Stage-2 stock with RS \u2265 70 whose low tagged the 20 EMA (within 1%) today and closed above it.","metric":"Dist to 20EMA %","fmt":"pct","sort":"rs"},{"id":"pb50","name":"Pullback to 50 DMA in uptrend","cat":"Trend & pullbacks","desc":"Stage-2 stock with RS \u2265 70 whose low tagged the 50 DMA (within 1.5%) and closed above it.","metric":"Dist to 50DMA %","fmt":"pct","sort":"rs"},{"id":"supertrend","name":"Supertrend turned bullish","cat":"Trend & pullbacks","desc":"Supertrend (10, 3) flipped from sell to buy in the last 2 sessions.","metric":null,"fmt":"num","sort":"rs"},{"id":"adx_strong","name":"Strong trend (ADX)","cat":"Trend & pullbacks","desc":"ADX(14) \u2265 25 and rising over 5 sessions with +DI above \u2212DI \u2014 a trend with real strength.","metric":"ADX","fmt":"num","sort":"metric"},{"id":"nr7","name":"NR7 in uptrend","cat":"Trend & pullbacks","desc":"Narrowest daily range of the last 7 sessions in a Stage-2 stock (Crabel) \u2014 a volatility pause that often precedes expansion.","metric":"Range %","fmt":"pct","sort":"rs"},{"id":"inside","name":"Inside day in uptrend","cat":"Trend & pullbacks","desc":"Today's high and low sit inside yesterday's range, in a Stage-2 stock with RS \u2265 70.","metric":null,"fmt":"num","sort":"rs"},{"id":"rsi60","name":"RSI crossed above 60","cat":"Oscillators","desc":"RSI(14) crossed up through 60 today with price above the 50 DMA \u2014 momentum regime shift (Andrew Cardwell's range rules).","metric":"RSI","fmt":"num","sort":"rs"},{"id":"rsi30","name":"RSI oversold bounce","cat":"Oscillators","desc":"RSI(14) crossed back above 30 in the last 2 sessions while the stock is still above its 200 DMA \u2014 a pullback in a long-term uptrend, not a falling knife.","metric":"RSI","fmt":"num","sort":"rs"},{"id":"macd_bull","name":"MACD bullish cross above zero","cat":"Oscillators","desc":"MACD (12, 26) crossed above its 9-day signal in the last 2 sessions while above the zero line.","metric":null,"fmt":"num","sort":"rs"},{"id":"squeeze","name":"Bollinger squeeze","cat":"Oscillators","desc":"Bollinger band width at its narrowest in 120 sessions with price above the 50 DMA \u2014 coiled for a move (John Bollinger).","metric":"BB width %","fmt":"pct","sort":"rs"},{"id":"rsline_lead","name":"RS line at new high before price","cat":"Relative strength","desc":"The stock's relative-strength line vs NIFTY 500 hit a 52-week high while price is still below its own high \u2014 a classic leadership tell (O'Neil's 'blue dot').","metric":"From 52wH %","fmt":"pct","sort":"rs"},{"id":"rs_up_mkt_down","name":"Up while market fell","cat":"Relative strength","desc":"Up 1% or more today while NIFTY 500 fell, RS \u2265 80 and volume above average \u2014 buying under pressure.","metric":"Day %","fmt":"pct","sort":"metric"},{"id":"down4","name":"4% breakdown day","cat":"Weakness","desc":"Down 4% or more today on volume above yesterday's. Exit check on holdings.","metric":"Day %","fmt":"pct","sort":"metric_asc"},{"id":"ema_down","name":"20 EMA crossed below 50 EMA","cat":"Weakness","desc":"Bearish crossover in the last 3 sessions, price below the 20 EMA.","metric":null,"fmt":"num","sort":"rs"},{"id":"below200","name":"Broke below 200 DMA on volume","cat":"Weakness","desc":"Crossed below the 200 DMA in the last 3 sessions, today's volume \u2265 1.5\u00d7 average.","metric":"Vol \u00d7","fmt":"x","sort":"rs"},{"id":"death","name":"Death cross","cat":"Weakness","desc":"50 DMA crossed below the 200 DMA in the last 5 sessions.","metric":null,"fmt":"num","sort":"rs"},{"id":"low52","name":"New 52-week closing low","cat":"Weakness","desc":"Closed below the lowest close of the previous 252 sessions.","metric":null,"fmt":"num","sort":"rs"},{"id":"gap_down","name":"Gap down not filled","cat":"Weakness","desc":"Opened 2%+ below yesterday's close, stayed below yesterday's low, and closed below the open.","metric":"Gap %","fmt":"pct","sort":"metric_asc"}